  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Integracin de Energas Renovables del Nordeste de Brasil</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renewable Energy Integration Program for the Northeast of Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo para esta operacin es fortalecer la integracin de la generacin de energa de Fuentes Renovables Variables (FRV) de la regin Nordeste de Brasil en el sistema integrado nacional, promoviendo capital privado para descarbonizar los servicios de suministro de energa. Los objetivos especficos de desarrollo incluyen: (i) ampliar la capacidad de transferencia de las redes de energa elctrica de la regin Nordeste; (ii) ampliar la financiacin de sistemas de energa elctrica que promuevan mayor flexibilidad del sistema elctrico brasileo; y (iii) apoyar la implementacin de tecnologas de almacenamiento de energa.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective for this transaction is to strengthen the integration of energy generation from Variable Renewable Sources (VRS) in Brazil&apos;s Northeast region into the national integrated system, promoting private capital to decarbonize energy supply services. The specific development objectives include: (i) expand the transfer capacity of the Northeast region&apos;s electric power grids; (ii) expand the financing of electric power systems that promote greater flexibility in the Brazilian electricity system; and (iii) support the implementation of energy storage technologies.</narrative>
  </description>
